      "id": "claim_3e0eebc2b48b47eeb6a980101a634e81",
      "statement": "src/dict.ts owns the token-dictionary substitution layer; every *Reverse map is derived from its encode map via the reverseMap helper (swapping keys and values), so encode and decode tables are always exact inverses and cannot drift apart.",
