      "statement": "HashFuncMap (RFC 8122 section 5) maps fingerprint hash functions to digits (sha-1 to 1, sha-256 to 3, etc); MediaConnectionAddressTypeMap maps IP4 to 4 and IP6 to 6 and MediaConnectionIPMap maps 0.0.0.0 to 0; ExtmapURIMap maps 16 common WebRTC extension URNs to short letters A through P; RtcpFbMap maps common RTCP feedback types (nack pli to P, goog-remb to G, transport-cc to T, ccm fir to C, nack to N).",
