      "id": "claim_830897a2abb94b16a643ad2d9cc11ded",
      "statement": "rtcpFbEncode and rtcpFbDecode use makeRegexSubstitution with longestFirst set to true, which sorts map keys by length (longest first) and builds a single regex with alternation; this ordering is required so the multi-word 'nack pli' is matched before the shorter 'nack' would otherwise consume the prefix and leave 'pli' behind.",
